SUMMARY:💧🌊The Cooling Current-A Water Element Sound Bath💧🌊
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**💧🌊The Cooling C
 urrent-A Water Element Sound Bath💧🌊**\n\nFeeling the heat of summer?
  Join me for a deeply restorative sound bath inspired by the soothing\, fl
 owing energy of the water element. Allow the healing vibrations of crystal
  singing bowls\, rainstick\, ocean drum and gentle chimes to wash over you
 \, helping to release tension\, calm the nervous system\, and invite a sen
 se of ease\, renewal\, and inner peace.\n\nLike a cool mountain stream\, t
 his experience offers an opportunity to slow down\, soften\, and reconnect
  with your natural state of flow. 💙✨\n\n🗓 Sunday\, July 19\, 2026\
 n🕐 1:00 PM\n💵 Sliding Scale: $10–$20\n⏰ Please arrive 15 minutes
  early to settle in\, get comfortable\, and claim your spot. First come\, 
 first served.\n\n**🧘 What to Bring:**\n• Yoga mat or something comfor
 table to lie on\n• Blanket & pillow for extra coziness\n• Anything els
 e to help you feel relaxed and supported\n\nCome immerse yourself in heali
 ng sound and allow yourself to be carried by The Cooling Current into stil
 lness\, balance\, and deep relaxation. 🌊💙\n\n#AshevilleNC #SoundHeal
 ing #AshevilleEvents #SoundBath #Meditation #CrystalBowls #WaterElement #R
 elaxation #SelfCare #SerenitySoundHealing #SummerWellness #MindBodySpirit
